<title>JAPAN: MOF to hold T-bill auction on Tuesday--sources.</title>
<headline>MOF to hold T-bill auction on Tuesday--sources.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finance Ministry is likely to hold a three-month Treasury bill auction on Tuesday, a financial market source said on Friday.</p>
<p>The issue amount is likely to be around 1.3 trillion yen, another market source said.</p>
<p>--Tokyo Treasury Desk, +81-3-5473-3748</p>
</text>
